      ""novelty_and_significance_justification"": ""A general quantitative framework for comparing allostery across proteins would be highly significant. The combination of dynamic order parameters, DMS, and evolutionary information is novel, though related concepts such as correlation networks and mutual information have substantial prior literature."",
      ""rigor_of_approach_score"": 3,
