      ""relevance_to_emergent_phenomena_justification"": ""Protein turnover is an emergent property of sequence, structure, translation, degradation, chaperone interactions, cellular state, and evolutionary context. The proposal directly seeks system-level principles that cannot be inferred from individual proteins alone."",
      ""novelty_and_significance_score"": 4,
      ""novelty_and_significance_justification"": ""A harmonized cross-species protein stability resource would be significant and appears not to currently exist in comparable form. The scientific questions are important, although some determinants of half-life have been studied before and novelty depends on successful integration at scale."",
      ""rigor_of_approach_score"": 4,
